### OpenAPI document
GET http://localhost:5274/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

###

### Get all tickets
GET http://localhost:5274/api/tickets
Accept: application/json

###

### Get missing ticket
GET http://localhost:5274/api/tickets/9999
Accept: application/json

###

### Create valid ticket
POST http://localhost:5274/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Printer broken",
  "description": "Office printer not working"
}

###

### Create invalid ticket - validation error
POST http://localhost:5274/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "Office printer not working"
}

###

### Update ticket status
PATCH http://localhost:5274/api/tickets/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": 2
}


###

### Check security headers
GET http://localhost:5274/
Accept: text/html

###

### Create invalid ticket - empty title
POST http://localhost:5274/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "Office printer not working"
}

###

### Create invalid ticket - empty description
POST http://localhost:5274/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Printer broken",
  "description": ""
}

###

### Create invalid ticket - too long title
POST http://localhost:5274/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "description": "Office printer not working"
}

###

### MVC Create without anti-forgery token - should be rejected
POST http://localhost:5274/Tickets/Create
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Title=CSRF test&Description=Request without token

