### LAB 11 CORE - Protected API without login
GET http://localhost:5274/api/tickets
Accept: application/json

### STRETCH - DELETE without login should return 401
DELETE http://localhost:5274/api/tickets/1
Accept: application/json


@baseUrl = http://localhost:5274

  ### AMBITNE 1 - Login Admin
POST http://localhost:5274/api/ambitne/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@unidesk.local",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}


### AMBITNE 2 - Get tickets without token - should return 401
GET http://localhost:5274/api/ambitne/tickets
Accept: application/json


### AMBITNE 3 - Get tickets as Admin - should return 200
GET http://localhost:5274/api/ambitne/tickets
Authorization: Bearer WKLEJ_ADMIN_TOKEN
Accept: application/json


### AMBITNE 4 - Check Admin EmployeeId claim - should return 200
GET http://localhost:5274/api/ambitne/tickets/me
Authorization: Bearer WKLEJ_ADMIN_TOKEN
Accept: application/json


### AMBITNE 5 - Admin DELETE - should return 204 or 404
DELETE http://localhost:5274/api/ambitne/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer WKLEJ_ADMIN_TOKEN
Accept: application/json


### AMBITNE 6 - Login normal user Varya
POST http://localhost:5274/api/ambitne/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "varya@gmail.com",
  "password": "Meduza2004"
}


### AMBITNE 7 - Check normal user EmployeeId claim - should return 200
GET http://localhost:5274/api/ambitne/tickets/me
Authorization: Bearer WKLEJ_VARYA_TOKEN
Accept: application/json


### AMBITNE 8 - Normal user DELETE - should return 403
DELETE http://localhost:5274/api/ambitne/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer WKLEJ_VARYA_TOKEN
Accept: application/json


### AMBITNE 9 - Normal user wrong domain - should return 403
GET http://localhost:5274/api/ambitne/tickets/domain-resource
Authorization: Bearer WKLEJ_VARYA_TOKEN
Accept: application/json


